        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alison Moyet, Mike Muir\n- Works: \"When I Was Your Girl\", The Minutes\n- Bands: Suicidal Tendencies, Los Cycos, Infectious Grooves\n- Places: Venice, California\n\nFacts:\n- Alison Moyet was born on 18 June 1961.\n- Alison Moyet is an English singer, songwriter, and performer noted for her bluesy contralto voice.\n- Mike Muir was born on March 14, 1963.\n- Mike Muir is the lead vocalist of the Venice, California crossover thrash bands Suicidal Tendencies and Los Cycos and the funk metal band Infectious Grooves.\n- \"When I Was Your Girl\" is a song by English singer-songwriter Alison Moyet.\n- \"When I Was Your Girl\" was released as the first single from Alison Moyet's eighth studio album, The Minutes.\n- The Minutes debuted at number five in the UK Albums Chart on 12 May 2013.",
